      },
      "message": "fix(sim): scope mark credit to the part(s) the operation marks\n\nScope `stock_sim::credit_marks` via `Mark::target` so a part-source\nEngrave or Trace credits only its own source entities' facets (and reads\nthose facets' own tops and undersides), while a stock-source mark keeps\n`target: None` and credits every part in the setup.\n\nFixes #1627",
